# steam_appid.txt — development App ID for the Steam client
#
# Copy this file to steam_appid.txt at the Unity project root (same folder as Assets/)
# and replace the number below with your registered Steam App ID from
# https://partner.steamgames.com — see docs/steam.md (#300 / #302).
#
# steam_appid.txt is gitignored. Do not commit a real App ID file.
#
# Spacewar (480) is Valve's public test App ID — useful only after Steamworks.NET
# is linked and the Steam client is running. Until then NullSteamClient stays
# unavailable even if this file exists (#301 / #305).

480
